{
	"ID": "20250918204641-kw8mbv0",
	"Spec": "1",
	"Type": "NodeDocument",
	"Properties": {
		"id": "20250918204641-kw8mbv0",
		"title": "UPL6-2——动态批处理",
		"type": "doc",
		"updated": "20250919002231"
	},
	"Children": [
		{
			"ID": "20250918204641-bqx0ina",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"HeadingLevel": 1,
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250918204641-bqx0ina",
				"updated": "20250919001050"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "动态批处理"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20250918204824-elhs0lb",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250918204824-elhs0lb",
				"updated": "20250918204847"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "动态批处理（Dynamic Batching）是一种由 Unity 自动完成的 CPU 端优化技术\n它会在运行时把多个使用相同材质的动态物体的网格数据合并到一次 DrawCall 中\n从而减少 DrawCall 的调用次数，降低 CPU 提交渲染命令的开销"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20250918204849-wzt3fvq",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250918204849-wzt3fvq",
				"updated": "20250918204850"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "它的 3 个重要优势："
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20250918204829-mzfnri6",
			"Type": "NodeList",
			"ListData": {
				"Typ": 1
			},
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250918204829-mzfnri6",
				"updated": "20250918204832"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"ID": "20250918204829-035dkyr",
					"Type": "NodeListItem",
					"ListData": {
						"Typ": 1,
						"Delimiter": 46,
						"Marker": "MS4=",
						"Num": 1
					},
					"Properties": {
						"id": "20250918204829-035dkyr",
						"updated": "20250918204829"
					},
					"Children": [
						{
							"ID": "20250918204829-uvmj3x7",
							"Type": "NodeParagraph",
							"Properties": {
								"id": "20250918204829-uvmj3x7",
								"updated": "20250918204829"
							},
							"Children": [
								{
									"Type": "NodeText",
									"Data": "批处理在运行时生成"
								}
							]
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"ID": "20250918204829-omfj6da",
					"Type": "NodeListItem",
					"ListData": {
						"Typ": 1,
						"Delimiter": 46,
						"Marker": "Mi4=",
						"Num": 2
					},
					"Properties": {
						"id": "20250918204829-omfj6da",
						"updated": "20250918204832"
					},
					"Children": [
						{
							"ID": "20250918204829-j6tukp5",
							"Type": "NodeParagraph",
							"Properties": {
								"id": "20250918204829-j6tukp5",
								"updated": "20250918204832"
							},
							"Children": [
								{
									"Type": "NodeText",
									"Data": "批处理中包含的对象在不同帧之间可能有所不同，取决于哪些网格在主摄像机视图中当前可见"
								}
							]
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"ID": "20250918204829-pec4209",
					"Type": "NodeListItem",
					"ListData": {
						"Typ": 1,
						"Delimiter": 46,
						"Marker": "My4=",
						"Num": 3
					},
					"Properties": {
						"id": "20250918204829-pec4209",
						"updated": "20250918204829"
					},
					"Children": [
						{
							"ID": "20250918204829-8tx2vtf",
							"Type": "NodeParagraph",
							"Properties": {
								"id": "20250918204829-8tx2vtf",
								"updated": "20250918204829"
							},
							"Children": [
								{
									"Type": "NodeText",
									"Data": "场景中运动的对象也可以批处理"
								}
							]
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20250918204824-98qy07e",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250918204824-98qy07e",
				"updated": "20250918234328"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "它的主要原理是：\nUnity 在渲染时，原本需要将每个物体的网格、材质数据通过 CPU 发送给 GPU，即一次 DrawCall\n假设 3 个相同材质的 3D 对象（网格可不同，材质需相同），渲染他们需要 3 次 DrawCall\n但是如果在开启动态批处理时，并且这些对象满足动态批处理的限制条件\n那么动态批处理会将这 3 个对象合并为一个更大的网格缓冲区，并和相同的材质一起，通过一次 DrawCall 提交给 GPU，从而达到减少 DrawCall 的目的"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20250918204908-09hxuza",
			"Type": "NodeBlockquote",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250918204908-09hxuza",
				"style": "background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);",
				"updated": "20250918204957"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeBlockquoteMarker",
					"Data": "\u003e"
				},
				{
					"ID": "20250918204957-rlermta",
					"Type": "NodeParagraph",
					"Properties": {
						"id": "20250918204957-rlermta",
						"updated": "20250918204957"
					},
					"Children": [
						{
							"Type": "NodeText",
							"Data": "注意：这种合并每帧都需要重新计算批次（即将满足条件的对象进行批处理），所以叫动态"
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20250918204824-8y6sqka",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250918204824-8y6sqka",
				"updated": "20250918205024"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "说人话：动态批处理是一种 Unity 在运行时，由 CPU 自动将满足限制条件的多个动态物体网格合并成一个大网格，一次性提交给 GPU，从而减少 DrawCall 的技术"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20250918204824-tef71kp",
			"Type": "NodeBlockquote",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250918204824-tef71kp",
				"style": "background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);",
				"updated": "20250918205114"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeBlockquoteMarker",
					"Data": "\u003e"
				},
				{
					"ID": "20250918205054-296rbk1",
					"Type": "NodeParagraph",
					"Properties": {
						"id": "20250918205054-296rbk1",
						"updated": "20250918205054"
					},
					"Children": [
						{
							"Type": "NodeText",
							"Data": "注意："
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"ID": "20250918205026-a3pcnge",
					"Type": "NodeList",
					"ListData": {
						"Typ": 1
					},
					"Properties": {
						"id": "20250918205026-a3pcnge",
						"updated": "20250918205114"
					},
					"Children": [
						{
							"ID": "20250918205026-d9l7jzp",
							"Type": "NodeListItem",
							"ListData": {
								"Typ": 1,
								"Delimiter": 46,
								"Marker": "MS4=",
								"Num": 1
							},
							"Properties": {
								"id": "20250918205026-d9l7jzp",
								"updated": "20250918205114"
							},
							"Children": [
								{
									"ID": "20250918205026-7ll9f93",
									"Type": "NodeParagraph",
									"Properties": {
										"id": "20250918205026-7ll9f93",
										"updated": "20250918205114"
									},
									"Children": [
										{
											"Type": "NodeText",
											"Data": "动态批处理是"
										},
										{
											"Type": "NodeTextMark",
											"TextMarkType": "strong",
											"TextMarkTextContent": "内置渲染管线"
										},
										{
											"Type": "NodeText",
											"Data": "中的重要优化手段，SRP（URP / HDRP）管线中主要采用 SRP Batcher（我们之后会讲解）"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"ID": "20250918205026-vzyiym6",
							"Type": "NodeListItem",
							"ListData": {
								"Typ": 1,
								"Delimiter": 46,
								"Marker": "Mi4=",
								"Num": 2
							},
							"Properties": {
								"id": "20250918205026-vzyiym6",
								"updated": "20250918205026"
							},
							"Children": [
								{
									"ID": "20250918205026-zdvte7t",
									"Type": "NodeParagraph",
									"Properties": {
										"id": "20250918205026-zdvte7t",
										"updated": "20250918205051"
									},
									"Children": [
										{
											"Type": "NodeText",
											"Data": "Unity 中创建了一个对象，但是 DrawCall 并不是增长了 1 次，而是 n 次，是因为阴影、深度等贴图以及多 Pass、透明、子网格、多材质都会增加 DrawCall 的次数"
										}
									]
								}
							]
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20250918205210-c7c0je9",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"HeadingLevel": 2,
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20250918205210-c7c0je9",
